        "References: {}\nNarSize: 123\nURL: nar/{file_hash}.nar.zst\nStorePath: /nix/store/{store_hash}-{name}\nX-Unknown: preserved verbatim\nSig: cache:nhQ==\nCompression: zstd\nNarHash: sha256:{}\n",
