2	//! Cloudflare request, environment, R2 bucket, KV namespace, Cache API, and
3	//! outbound GitHub calls into cachet-core decisions and renders results.
4	//! All ambient clock, entropy, and I/O live here behind the seams; the
5	//! signing key enters only as a Workers secret binding and is never logged
6	//! or returned.
